Code Alpha – Hangman Game

A simple text-based Hangman game developed using Python as part of my Code Alpha Python Programming Internship.

Features

* Random word selection
* Guess one letter at a time
* Six incorrect guesses allowed
* Win and game-over messages
* Input validation

Technologies Used

* Python
* Random module
* Loops and conditional statements

How to Run

1. Install Python 3.
2. Download or clone this repository.
3. Open the terminal in the project folder.
4. Run:
    python3 hangman.py

